meta {
  name: Publisher
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Failure modes for /v1/publisher/* endpoints.

  Covers: missing state, invalid base64, HMAC mismatch, expired state, unknown publisher order,
  publisher feature disabled (503), and invalid execution_mode on credential creation.

  The callback gate tests (missing/invalid/expired state) are safe to run unauthenticated
  — they all fail before touching the database.
}
